# Branching

**Canonical hard truth:** [`docs/branching.md`](../../docs/branching.md)

Feature work branches from and merges into `develop`; `main` is release-only.

Work branches are named `<type>/<kebab-case-summary>` with a commitlint type (`feat`, `fix`,
`docs`, `chore`, `ci`, `test`, `refactor`, `perf`, `build`, `style`, `revert`). A generated branch
name with a random suffix gets renamed before the first push.
